  m_Name: Informant Vane
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Informant Vane
  offerText: I have acquired some highly sensitive documents regarding your past.
    Pay my extortionate fee now, and I will hand them over. Refuse, and the authorities
    will receive them.
  acceptResultText: You angrily pay the blackmail. He hands over the thick files.
    You are significantly poorer, but the intense relief of safety washes over you.
  rejectResultText: You call his bluff and tell him to get out! You pace the room
    nervously, hoping he was just fishing for coins.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Vane wasn't bluffing! The authorities raid your room, violently
    interrogate you, and seize your assets in crippling fines.
